  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> Baron’s Imposing Mausoleum</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> at least two drawbacks from among Addictive Casting, Decrepit Casting, Draining Casting, Madness Mantra, Variant Madness Mantra, Narcoleptic Casting, Painful Magic, Unsettling Casting, or other drawbacks at GM discretion.</p>\n<strong>Benefits:</strong>\n<p> Whenever you use a magic sphere effect which costs 1 or more spell points and would incur the effects of two or more of the drawbacks you used to meet the prerequisites of this feat, roll a d20. Depending on the d20 result, you only suffer the effects from among some of the above drawbacks you possess (see Table: Rerouted Cost Results to determine which specifically you are affected by).</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>D20 result</th>\n<th>Drawback effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>All, and the drawbacks take effect as if you had spent 1 additional spell point.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2-4</td>\n<td>All but 1, chosen randomly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5-7</td>\n<td>All but 1, chosen by you</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8-10</td>\n<td>All but 2, chosen randomly (minimum 1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>11-13</td>\n<td>All but 2, chosen by you (minimum 1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>14-16</td>\n<td>All but 3, chosen by randomly (minimum 1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>17-19</td>\n<td>All but 3, chosen by you (minimum 1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>None, and the cost of the magic sphere effect is reduced by 1 (to a minimum of 1).</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/drawback-feats#toc66\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
